<cp:coreProperties xmlns:cp="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/package/2006/metadata/core-properties" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:dcmitype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <cp:category>model</cp:category>
  <dcterms:created xsi:type="dcterms:W3CDTF">1999-01-14T00:54:17Z</dcterms:created>
  <dc:creator>WeiLi</dc:creator>
  <dc:description>The Model initialization function Callback automatically

sets the sample time  to 2e-6 sec.  and loads the initial

states vector xInitial. The initial state vector is saved in the

power_acdrive_init.mat file.



Check  the Initial state checkbox in the Simulation 

parameters/Workspace I/O to start in steady state with a

speed of 120 rad/s and a torque of 0 N.m/s, 


Copyright 2008-2015 The MathWorks, Inc.
</dc:description>
  <cp:lastModifiedBy>KeXing</cp:lastModifiedBy>
  <dcterms:modified xsi:type="dcterms:W3CDTF">2026-04-27T00:42:29Z</dcterms:modified>
  <cp:revision>m1v1r4.359</cp:revision>
  <cp:version>R2024b</cp:version>
</cp:coreProperties>

